    - Key: ABBIE_Hello
      Value:
      - Hi... I'm new here. I hope everything is alright?
      - "Bonjour\r"
    - Key: MAX_Hello
      Value:
      - Good morning!
      - "Bonjour\r"
    - Key: 'ROSA_Hello '
      Value:
      - Hello, dear!
      - "Bonjour mon ch\xE9rie\r"
    - Key: LI_Hello
      Value:
      - "Oh. You\u2019re new. Uh\u2026 hi."
      - "Jour...\r"
    - Key: DEVI_Hello
      Value:
      - "\u2026What? Is there something on my face?"
      - "\r"
    - Key: CONNIE_1
      Value:
      - "Hey, fella!\xA4You\u2019re new here, am I right?\xA4\u2026eh, who am I kidding.\xA4Everyone
        on this floor knows about our little newcomer.\xA4Sorry, 'guess that wasn\u2019t
        the warm welcome you expected on your first day\u2026\xA4Ah, don\u2019t blame
        them. They\u2019re a lil' on edge lately. Thought I\u2019d at least come
        by and give you something of a greeting.\xA4\u2026Hey, y'know what? You seem
        alright, so I\u2019m gonna clue you in on a little something.\xA4Tomorrow,
        company\u2019s about to hand over some long overdue promotions to its best
        soldiers.\xA4That\u2019s the reason everyone\u2019s shooting daggers at each
        other right now.\xA4And of course, duty will fall on you to decide who\u2019s
        most deserving of the honors.\xA4I know, \u2018might be a lil\u2019 overwhelming
        to already undertake responsibilities like this just as you came in.\xA4I
        mean, you don\u2019t even know anyone here! And it\u2019s not like you got
        anyone rooting for you. If anything, most of them will want to tear you apart
        as soon as you give them a warning.\xA4Take my bit of advice. Don\u2019t
        let them. Doing what you do, you\u2019re bound to make some enemies anyway.
        Can\u2019t please everyone.\xA4But earning a few friends here and there can
        go a long way towards making you fit in.\xA4Anyways, just my two cents. Took
        enough of your time, and need to go back to the deed myself. And remember:
        I am rooting for you, pal!"
      - "\r"
    - Key: DEVI_1
      Value:
      - ...
      - "\r"
    - Key: MAX_1
      Value:
      - "Oh! Sorry for surprising you.\xA4Didn\u2019t expect to see a new face here.
        Forgot you were replacing the other guy.\xA4A shame. I quite liked him. Though
        I\u2019m sure you\u2019ll fit right in as well!\xA4Anyway, nice to meet you!
        Don\u2019t worry, I probably won\u2019t make your job too hard. My reports
        are always flawless.\xA4See you tomorrow!"
      - "\r"
    - Key: CONNIE_2_A
      Value:
      - "Hey, pal!\xA4Nice one the other day. Very funny.\xA4\u2026Don\u2019t do
        that again.\xA4But hey. No offense taken.\xA4\u2026\xA4So! Met any new friends?\xA4Not
        much like you\u2019re spoiled for choice. It\u2019s only the four of us here.\xA4\u2026Five,
        if you count Esteban; though the guy doesn\u2019t talk much.\xA4Ahem, neither
        does Devi, to be honest.\xA4And Max\u2026 she\u2019s probably the worst of
        the bunch.\xA4All smiles, and just ready to plant a dagger in your back when
        you least expect it.\xA4Again, I\u2019d be wary of who you trust. It\u2019s
        a shark tank here, and you wouldn\u2019t believe the lengths some people
        go just to earn a promotion.\xA4Glad you\u2019re one of the good ones!"
      - "\r"
    - Key: CONNIE_2_B
      Value:
      - "Hey, pal!\xA4Thanks for covering my ass yesterday.\xA4Knew you were a real
        mate.\xA4Really appreciate it. And you know I\u2019ll return the favor.\xA4So!
        Met any new friends?\xA4Not much like you\u2019re spoiled for choice. It\u2019s
        only the four of us here.\xA4\u2026Five, if you count Esteban; though the
        guy doesn\u2019t talk much.\xA4Ahem, neither does Devi, to be honest. And
        Max\u2026 she\u2019s probably the worst of the bunch.\xA4All smiles, and
        just ready to plant a dagger in your back when you least expect it.\xA4Again,
        I\u2019d be wary of who you trust. It\u2019s a shark tank here, and you wouldn\u2019t
        believe the lengths some people go just to earn a promotion.\xA4Glad you\u2019re
        one of the good ones!"
      - "\r"
    - Key: LI_1
      Value:
      - "Oh. You\u2019re new.\xA4Uh\u2026 hi."
      - "\r"
    - Key: DEVI_2
      Value:
      - "\u2026\xA4What? Is there something on my face?"
